{
 "title": "Copy 与 Move 类型",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "类型分属两组。**Copy 类型**（数字、`bool`、`str`、普通结构体、由 Copy 元素组成的数组）生活在栈上，复制开销很小。**Move 类型**（`List`、`Box`、`string` 以及包含它们的任何类型）拥有堆内存；它们从不被复制，只会被**移动**（这样就不会重复释放）。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    a = 5",
    "    b = a",
    "    b += 1",
    "    print(a, b)",
    "",
    "    list_a = List[i32]()",
    "    list_a.push(10)",
    "    list_b = list_a",
    "    list_c = list_b.clone()",
    "    list_c.push(20)",
    "    print(list_b.len, list_c.len)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "5 6",
    "1 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "对数字来说，`b = a` 是复制；`a` 仍然可用。对列表来说，`list_b = list_a` 是移动所有权：现在只有 `list_b` 有效。如果想要独立的副本，就写 `.clone()`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c05-l04-x1",
   "prompt": "对列表 `original` 做一次 `.clone()`，命名为 `dup`，向 `dup` 中加入 99，并输出两个列表的长度。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    original = List[i32]()",
    "    original.push(1)",
    "    original.push(2)",
    "    print(original.len)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    original = List[i32]()",
    "    original.push(1)",
    "    original.push(2)",
    "    dup = original.clone()",
    "    dup.push(99)",
    "    print(original.len, dup.len)"
   ],
   "hint": "`dup = original.clone()` 和 `dup.push(99)`。",
   "expected": [
    "2 3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c05-l04-q1",
   "q": "哪个是 Move 类型？",
   "options": [
    "`i32`",
    "`List[i32]`",
    "`bool`"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`List` 存在于堆上，所以是移动；数字则是复制。"
  }
 ]
}
